      ToeicWeekThreeContent.q("R-P6-SPRINT-1605",ToeicPart.PART_6,ToeicSkill.CONJUNCTION,"Community Workshop Registration\nRegistration for the October workshop is now open. Participants may register online or at the front desk. [1] _____ the class size is limited to 24 people, early registration is recommended. A confirmation e-mail will be sent after payment [2] _____. Participants who need to cancel should notify us at least two days in advance. [3] _____, the registration fee can be transferred to a later session. The instructor will provide all materials, so attendees do not need to bring [4] _____.","Choose the best word for [1].",["Because","Despite","Unless","During"],0,"班级人数有限是建议尽早报名的原因，Because。","","because = since",25,ToeicDifficulty.EASY,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
