      ToeicWeekThreeContent.q("R-P6-SPRINT-1608",ToeicPart.PART_6,ToeicSkill.PRONOUN,"Community Workshop Registration\nRegistration for the October workshop is now open. Participants may register online or at the front desk. [1] _____ the class size is limited to 24 people, early registration is recommended. A confirmation e-mail will be sent after payment [2] _____. Participants who need to cancel should notify us at least two days in advance. [3] _____, the registration fee can be transferred to a later session. The instructor will provide all materials, so attendees do not need to bring [4] _____.","Choose the best word for [4].",["anything","someone","everywhere","another"],0,"bring 后需要表示“任何东西”的不定代词 anything。","","do not need to bring anything",22,ToeicDifficulty.EASY,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekThreeContent.q("R-P6-SPRINT-1609",ToeicPart.PART_6,ToeicSkill.WORD_FORM,"Dear Ms. Rivera,\nThank you for reporting the issue with your desk chair. A technician will visit your office tomorrow between 10 A.M. and noon. Please make sure the area around the chair is [1] _____ before the technician arrives. If the chair cannot be repaired on site, we [2] _____ a temporary replacement. The Facilities team expects most repairs to take less than thirty minutes. [3] _____, more complex problems may require the chair to be taken to the workshop. We appreciate [4] _____ cooperation.","Choose the best word for [1].",["clear","clearly","clearing","clarity"],0,"make the area + 形容词，选 clear。","","area is clear",22,ToeicDifficulty.EASY,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
