      ToeicWeekThreeContent.q("R-P6-SPRINT-1612",ToeicPart.PART_6,ToeicSkill.PRONOUN,"Dear Ms. Rivera,\nThank you for reporting the issue with your desk chair. A technician will visit your office tomorrow between 10 A.M. and noon. Please make sure the area around the chair is [1] _____ before the technician arrives. If the chair cannot be repaired on site, we [2] _____ a temporary replacement. The Facilities team expects most repairs to take less than thirty minutes. [3] _____, more complex problems may require the chair to be taken to the workshop. We appreciate [4] _____ cooperation.","Choose the best word for [4].",["you","your","yours","yourself"],1,"cooperation 前需要形容词性物主代词 your。","","your cooperation",20,ToeicDifficulty.EASY,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
