      ToeicWeekThreeContent.q("R-M2-P7-A-01",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"MEMO\nBeginning October 1, employees who cycle to work may use the new secured bicycle room in the west garage. Access requires a staff badge. Lockers are available on a first-come basis, but users must provide their own locks.","Why was the memo written?",["To explain access to a new bicycle room","To announce free bicycles","To close the west garage","To replace staff badges"],0,"备忘录介绍新自行车房的使用规则。","employees who cycle to work may use the new secured bicycle room","new bicycle room access",60,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.NORMAL),
